<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Chemopetrol signs seven year loan.</title>
<headline>Czech Chemopetrol signs seven year loan.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech petrochemical concern Chemopetrol a.s. on Tuesday signed a seven-year, 230 million mark syndicated loan, lead managed by Citibank International plc.</p>
<p>Officials speaking at a signing ceremony for the loan did not disclose any details of the interest rate for the credit.</p>
</text>
